{"id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-bounded-reducibility.md","title":"bT、wtt 与 ibT 可约","display":"df-bounded-reducibility — bT、wtt 与 ibT 可约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-bounded-reducibility","aliases":["20-df-bounded-reducibility"],"display":"df-bounded-reducibility — bT、wtt 与 ibT 可约","chapter":"3","section":"3.8","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.8.1","source_pdf_pages":[109],"source_printed_pages":[73],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-bounded-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-bounded-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-reducibility — bT、wtt 与 ibT 可约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.8.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>109</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<p>归约下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bT}\">\\(\\mathrm{bT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wtt}\">\\(\\mathrm{wtt}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ibT}\">\\(\\mathrm{ibT}\\)</span> 的类型是集合之间的二元关系，定义见 bounded-reducibility。\n上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}reducibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall x\\ u_e^B(x)&lt;h(x)],\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}B,\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\\n[\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall x\\ u_e^B(x)\\le x+1].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}reducibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall x\\ u_e^B(x)&lt;h(x)],\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}B,\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\\n[\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall x\\ u_e^B(x)\\le x+1].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本目录 use 取最大查询数加 1，ibT 正好允许查询至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。bT 的严格界可统一加 1；定义与原书仅相差这一索引约定。实际 oracle 下全停止，不要求在所有二进制答案组合下都停止。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.8.1；印刷页 73；PDF 第 109 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-use]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{bT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{wtt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ibT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}reducibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall x\\ u_e^B(x)<h(x)],\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}B,\\\\\nA\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\\n[\\Phi_e^B=\\chi_A\\land\\forall x\\ u_e^B(x)\\le x+1].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1742,"backlinks":[{"id":"c209552a90f2623f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-change-set]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"},{"id":"a36c6cd41d04cbcf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"}],"outgoing":["52376918bee1945e","4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","e343870c773cb68e"]}